            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "House Husband Extraordinaire"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made this when my brother-in-law popped in for a surprise visit. He said it reminded him of the \"rig food\" that he has to eat on the North Slope in Alaska. It was bland and visually unappetizing. I was embarrassed to have to serve it. I will be more cautious about using recipes with so few reviews in the future.",
