            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Sam"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was a simple and easy recipe, convenient for when you need a meal in a hurry. The taste was great, the corned beef was not as over-powering as it is in other meals. I got 3 servings from this recipe. I will definitely make it again. My husband also gave it 5 stars.",
